</div></section>
<div class="av-special-heading av-m5khz9vn-2376891f8bd3b1a0575d12c2118bc29c av-special-heading-h3 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-5 el_after_av_textblock el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">How Does the TheraLight 360 Work?</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5khzhj2-e173d580c832b11e72652d064bfd9639" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>The TheraLight 360 is not just a device—it’s a full-body transformation system. This advanced LED bed delivers precise wavelengths of red and near-infrared light to target your body’s cells. Unlike concentrated lasers, the TheraLight 360’s LED panels diffuse light evenly, ensuring maximum absorption and effectiveness.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5ms7gok-a5c8ff4354d6ea74c614f906fbd533fc" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>During each 10-minute session, your cells absorb the light, triggering a cascade of positive effects that support recovery, vitality, and anti-aging. It’s like giving your body the nutrients it needs to thrive—without pills, needles, or downtime.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-blcx7-8e298f9275f4a7f8d2086b1d99dd1a96 av_one_half avia-builder-el-8 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom"><div class="avia-image-container av-m4ebrt5y-bc94203a95d58498b257aba37e3b6e61 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-9 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Red light therapy in Miami. Infrared sauna for full-body recovery and promoting cellular health." class="wp-image-1310 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1310 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="961" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 961px) 100vw, 961px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami.webp 961w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-300x300.webp 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-80x80.webp 80w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-768x768.webp 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-36x36.webp 36w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-180x180.webp 180w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/red-light-therapy-miami-705x705.webp 705w" title="Da Vinci" width="961"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
