<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5ms93i8-0b5e6ba3fac28520b23a455553e8cf5f" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p style="text-align: center;">Red light therapy for pain, recovery, and anti-aging is an advanced, non-invasive treatment option that uses low-power red and near-infrared wavelengths to improve cellular health. Unlike traditional laser therapy, the TheraLight 360 system uses advanced Light Emitting Diode (LED) panels to deliver light in a “low light” format. This ensures a gentle, pain-free experience with no heat or discomfort.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Through a process called Photobiomodulation, red light penetrates the skin to activate your body’s natural healing processes at the cellular level. Here’s how it works:</p>
