<div class="flex_column_table av-m5mspnx4-bd0076e3e01c3c6fce639fb328c548b5 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m5mspnx4-bd0076e3e01c3c6fce639fb328c548b5 av_one_half avia-builder-el-36 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="av-special-heading av-m5msmnzv-46f33df41293c59a72ccce7160b686b9 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-37 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">The Casa Privée Experience</h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5msmiq4-a2efc8aca4d1550869c7bddaa6625bcd" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>At Casa Privée, we believe wellness should be a personal journey. That’s why our health professionals work with you to create a customized TheraLight 360 program tailored to your specific needs. Whether you’re focused on longevity, recovery, vitality, or anti-aging, we’ll help you achieve your goals.</p>
<p>Each session is quick, relaxing, and designed to fit into your busy schedule. In just 10 minutes, you’ll feel the difference as your body absorbs the light nutrients it needs to thrive.</p>
</div></section>
<div class="av-special-heading av-m5msndrn-35f0aef95a22909cc536634ebf419caa av-special-heading-h4 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-39 el_after_av_textblock el_before_av_textblock av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Experience the Power of the TheraLight 360</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5msnqvn-e488ae80c0fe6743307eeef75544484c" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Whether you need the best red light therapy for inflammation or pain, transform your wellness routine with the Da Vinci TheraLight 360 Full Body Wellness System. From recovery and performance to anti-aging and overall vitality, this revolutionary red light treatment in Miami offers a truly holistic approach to health.</p>
<p>Ready to take the next step? <a href="contact-us.php">Contact Casa Privée today</a> to book your session and unlock the power of the best red light therapy Miami has to offer for a healthier, more vibrant you!</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-gufqt-7c3e125d831834498a244f3a72dddc6b av_one_half avia-builder-el-41 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top"><div class="avia-image-container av-aq6qd-5d889003bfb8b238553692af286f3591 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-42 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Client booking an appointment for Miami red light therapy for pain. IR therapy at Casa Privée." class="wp-image-1312 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1312 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1024" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/booking-red-light-treatment.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/booking-red-light-treatment.webp 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/booking-red-light-treatment-225x300.webp 225w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/booking-red-light-treatment-529x705.webp 529w" title="Client booking an appointment for Miami red light therapy for pain. IR therapy at Casa Privée." width="768"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
