<div class="flex_column av-g8aod-dd23052bf736f0752d190f2bc02f91ad av_one_full avia-builder-el-43 el_after_av_section avia-builder-el-no-sibling first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-953y5-6f7dd8fd41ac9626d5d2effc0b57b4fc av-special-heading-h3 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-44 el_before_av_toggle_container avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">Frequently Asked Questions</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<div class="togglecontainer av-m8ds7nl4-b8057f0586d478c7ee17ec16b7e396ed av-elegant-toggle avia-builder-el-45 el_after_av_heading avia-builder-el-last toggle_close_all enable_toggles" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds2ink-70d1559fa8458cf2184fa21b5f3541a1" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: What is TheraLight 360 Red Light Therapy, and how does it work?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What is TheraLight 360 Red Light Therapy, and how does it work?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What is TheraLight 360 Red Light Therapy, and how does it work?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-1" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What is TheraLight 360 Red Light Therapy, and how does it work?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-1" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">What is TheraLight 360 Red Light Therapy, and how does it work?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-1" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-1" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>TheraLight 360 is a state-of-the-art, full-body wellness system that utilizes specific wavelengths of red and near-infrared light to enhance cellular health. This non-invasive therapy delivers light energy to the body’s tissues, stimulating cellular processes that lead to increased energy production, improved circulation, and reduced inflammation. By targeting the mitochondria, the powerhouses of the cell, TheraLight 360 promotes natural healing and rejuvenation.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds41b1-18a565837e4682f4ce454590d12afbc5" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-2" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-2" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">What conditions can TheraLight 360 help address?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-2" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-2" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>TheraLight 360 has been shown to be effective in managing various conditions, including:</p>
<ul>
<li data-pm-slice="0 0 []">Pain Management: Alleviates muscle and joint pain by increasing blood flow and reducing inflammation. ​</li>
<li>Skin Health: Improves the appearance of wrinkles, fine lines, age spots, and acne by stimulating collagen production. ​</li>
<li>Post-Exercise Recovery: Enhances muscle recovery and reduces fatigue after physical activity. ​</li>
<li>Mood and Sleep: Positively affects mood and sleep patterns by promoting relaxation and reducing stress. ​</li>
</ul>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds4w83-8c2a124faf1d1d778a0b5e72f24e8082" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: How is TheraLight 360 therapy administered, and what can I expect during a session?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: How is TheraLight 360 therapy administered, and what can I expect during a session?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: How is TheraLight 360 therapy administered, and what can I expect during a session?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-3" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="How is TheraLight 360 therapy administered, and what can I expect during a session?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-3" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">How is TheraLight 360 therapy administered, and what can I expect during a session?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-3" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-3" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>During a TheraLight 360 session, you will lie comfortably in the full-body light therapy bed. The device emits red and near-infrared light, enveloping your body. Each session typically lasts between 10 to 20 minutes, during which you may experience a gentle warming sensation as circulation increases. The treatment is relaxing and painless, with no downtime required afterward.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds5na2-d724bad9d27a8f7eb73900938dbb7282" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-4" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-4" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Is TheraLight 360 therapy safe, and are there any side effects?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-4" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-4" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>Yes, TheraLight 360 therapy is considered safe, non-toxic, and non-invasive, with no known negative side effects. Some users may experience a warming sensation due to increased circulation, but this is typically mild and temporary. Occasionally, clients might feel mild fatigue or discomfort after treatment, which usually subsides within 24 to 48 hours.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
<section class="av_toggle_section av-m8ds7la3-9e6650de5d395b1839ca7ccdfe8ee4c2" itemprop="mainEntity" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"><div class="single_toggle" data-tags="{All} " role="tablist"><p aria-controls="toggle-id-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Click to expand: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" class="toggler av-title-above" data-aria_collapsed="Click to expand: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-aria_expanded="Click to collapse: Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-fake-id="#toggle-id-5" data-slide-speed="200" data-title="Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?" data-title-open="" id="toggle-toggle-id-5" itemprop="name" role="tab" tabindex="0">Who can benefit from TheraLight 360 therapy?<span class="toggle_icon"><span class="vert_icon"></span><span class="hor_icon"></span></span></p><div aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="toggle-toggle-id-5" class="toggle_wrap av-title-above" id="toggle-id-5" itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer" role="region" tabindex="-1"><div class="toggle_content invers-color" itemprop="text"><p>TheraLight 360 therapy is suitable for individuals seeking to improve muscle performance, reduce pain and inflammation, enhance joint mobility, and promote overall wellness. It also benefits those looking to improve sleep patterns, mood, and skin health. However, individuals who are pregnant, have cancer, or have had organ transplants should consult with <a href="about-bankole-johnson.php">Dr. Johnson</a> before undergoing therapy.</p>
</div></div></div></section>
